Error [E0105]: `same name` is defined twice
  --> tests/ui/test_duplicate_name.jet:4:7
    |
  4 | #Test("same name") {
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: every test needs a unique name so failures are easy to find
 Fix: rename or remove one of the definitions

Error [E0101]: this program has no `main` function
 Why: running a program starts at `fn main`, and the entry file doesn't define one
 Fix: add `fn main() { ... }` to the entry file
